/datapin
.env
coverage/

# Generated by datapin itself: the roff man page (`make man`, i.e.
# `datapin man --out man/datapin.1`). Its SOURCE is the live cobra tree.
/man/

# Serena MCP local project cache
.serena/

# Agent-local state, not project source: skill installs (npx skills add),
# agent worktrees, and scheduler locks. The skill SOURCE of truth is
# skills/datapin/SKILL.md, guarded by cmd/skill_doc_test.go — installed
# copies must never be committed or they become a second, untested copy.
.agents/
.claude/skills/
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
skills-lock.json
